  "_doc": [
    "Offline end-of-support data (FR-034, research.md A3).",
    "",
    "A pinned snapshot ships with the payload so the check works offline and",
    "deterministically, matching the precedent set for cwe_map.json in feature 001",
    "R6 (ship standards data, never look it up live).",
    "",
    "Staleness is itself reportable: when dataset_date is older than",
    "staleness_threshold_days the report says so, because presenting stale support",
    "data as current would be exactly the kind of unearned confidence this feature",
    "exists to remove. Refresh is an explicit operator action, never an implicit",
    "network fetch.",
    "",
    "`identifier_map` exists because package-manager names and dataset product ids",
    "do not coincide. Extending either map is a data change (FR-025b)."
